<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>com.github.JayDay.RMG-K</id>
  <name>RMG-Gekkonet</name>
  <summary>Play Nintendo 64 games online with rollback netcode</summary>
  <developer id="com.github.jayday">
    <name>JayDay</name>
  </developer>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>GPL-3.0-only</project_license>
  <description>
    <p>RMG-Gekkonet is a fork of Rosalie's Mupen GUI, a free and open-source mupen64plus front-end focused on online play. It features GekkoNet rollback netcode for smooth peer-to-peer sessions, as well as traditional Kaillera server support.</p>
    <p>Additional features include a Kaillera server browser, NAT traversal without port forwarding, session replays, in-game chat, and support for Raphnet N64 adapters and GameCube controller adapters.</p>
  </description>
